OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785226691
OL,3,CTate brothers to remain in US jail for
OL,4,Cat least two weeks
OL,6,FAndrew and his brother Tristan will
OL,7,Fremain in jail in the US for at least
OL,8,Ftwo weeks as they fight extradition to
OL,9,Fthe United Kingdom, where they are
OL,10,Faccused of rape and sex trafficking.
OL,12,FOn Monday, US Magistrate Lauren Louis
OL,13,Fset a detention hearing for August 13
OL,14,Fto determine whether the brothers
OL,15,Fshould remain in jail after that or be
OL,16,Freleased, during what could be a
OL,17,Fmonth's long extradition process.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
