OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785226691
OL,3,CTate brothers to remain in US jail for
OL,4,Cat least two weeks
OL,6,FThe Tates were not in court on Monday
OL,7,For required to be there and have
OL,8,Fremained in jail since making a brief
OL,9,Fcourt appearance two days after their
OL,10,FJuly 18 arrest.
OL,12,FThe brothers have become among the
OL,13,Fworld's most polarising internet
OL,14,Fpersonalities with their promotion of
OL,15,Fwealth, male dominance and misogyny
OL,16,Fthrough their social media empire.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
