OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785226691
OL,3,CTate brothers to remain in US jail for
OL,4,Cat least two weeks
OL,6,FThe new allegations are the latest in
OL,7,Fa long-running international legal
OL,8,Fsaga involving the Tates that has
OL,9,Fspanned the US, Britain and Romania.
OL,10,FThe brothers have repeatedly denied
OL,11,Fwrongdoing.
OL,13,FAttorneys for the pair said on Monday
OL,14,Fthat they want the US government to
OL,15,Fturn over the documents submitted by
OL,16,FUK officials submitted to secure their
OL,17,Farrest.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
