PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785226691
OL,3,CTate brothers to remain in US jail for
OL,4,Cat least two weeks
OL,6,F"They don't have anything but the
OL,7,Faccusations," attorney Joseph McBride
OL,8,Fsaid after the hearing. "It's just
OL,9,Ftheir word against our word right now."
OL,11,FThe UK has until mid-September to turn
OL,12,Fover all of its materials to the State
OL,13,FDepartment, Assistant US Attorney
OL,14,FAlejandra Lopez said in court.The
OL,15,Fbrothers have long claimed that their
OL,16,Fviolent and misogynistic statements
OL,17,Fhave been taken out of context or were
OL,18,Fintended as jokes.
