OL,3,CTate brothers to remain in US jail for
OL,4,Cat least two weeks
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FThe former professional kickboxers,
OL,12,Fwho have dual US and UK citizenship,
OL,13,Fhave millions of social media
OL,14,Ffollowers and are vocal supporters of
OL,15,FUS President Donald Trump. The White
OL,16,FHouse has said the brothers shouldn't
OL,17,Fexpect any help from the president.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
