OL,3,CTate brothers to remain in US jail for
OL,4,Cat least two weeks
OL,6,FMcBride said shortly after the Tates
OL,7,Fwere arrested that "they've never done
OL,8,Fnothing wrong". He claimed the
OL,9,Fextradition attempt was politically
OL,10,Fmotivated, though he provided no
OL,11,Fdetails.
OL,13,FProsecutors in Britain said the new
OL,14,Fcharges relate to four new accusers
OL,15,Fand were brought after authorities
OL,16,Freceived evidence from police in
OL,17,FBedfordshire.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
