OL,3,CTate brothers to remain in US jail for
OL,4,Cat least two weeks
OL,6,FThe allegations, which span from 2010
OL,7,Fto 2017, include rape, assault,
OL,8,Ftrafficking and offenses relating to
OL,9,F"indecent images of a child and
OL,10,Fextreme pornography".
OL,12,FThe brothers are already charged with
OL,13,Frape, bodily harm, human trafficking
OL,14,Fand controlling prostitution for gain
OL,15,Frelating to three other accusers in
OL,16,Fthe UK between 2012 and 2015.
