OL,3,CTate brothers to remain in US jail for
OL,4,Cat least two weeks
OL,6,FThe brothers moved to Romania in 2016
OL,7,Fand were arrested there in 2022,
OL,8,Faccused of participating in schemes to
OL,9,Flure women for sexual exploitation.
OL,10,FThey denied those allegations, and the
OL,11,FRomanian case has not gone forward
OL,12,Fbecause of legal and procedural
OL,13,Fproblems.
OL,15,FAndrew Tate, 39, became known a decade
OL,16,Fago when he was a contestant on the
OL,17,Freality TV show Big Brother. He was
OL,18,Fforced to leave the show when a video
OL,19,Fappeared to show him assaulting a
OL,20,Fwoman.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
