OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785226691
OL,3,CTate brothers to remain in US jail for
OL,4,Cat least two weeks
OL,6,FHe has amassed over 10 million
OL,7,Ffollowers on X but has been banned
OL,8,Ffrom other platforms, including
OL,9,FYouTube, TikTok and Instagram, for
OL,10,Fviolating hate speech guidelines.
OL,12,FHe has made widely condemned comments,
OL,13,Fsuch as saying women who are sexually
OL,14,Fassaulted should bear some
OL,15,Fresponsibility for the attacks and
OL,16,Fsharing graphic descriptions of how he
OL,17,Fmight attack women.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/9
